sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant PF as PocketForge
  participant Agent as Frontier agent
  participant Git as Local Git workspace
  participant Build as Local build engine
  User->>PF: Create mission
  PF->>Agent: Delegate bounded task
  Agent-->>PF: Return patch
  PF->>User: Present diff
  User->>PF: Approve
  PF->>Git: Apply to isolated branch
  PF->>Build: Build and test
  Build-->>PF: APK and evidence
